            "widgets_values": [
                "1. In the ComfyUI menu, open **Extensions**, then **KIE**, then **KIE Settings**, and save your key.\n2. Describe your host in **Host**.\n3. Press **Run**. The video goes to `video/kie`."
            ],
            "title": "Start Here"
        },
