            "properties": {
                "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
            },
            "widgets_values": [
                "**File: Add** gives Wan 3.0 the host as `first_frame_url`. Wan starts on the host and makes a five-second video. `resolution` is `480P`, because Wan makes 1080P by default. Wan names its sound switch `audio`, so `\"audio\": false` goes in `arguments`.\n\nKIE has no cancel. If you cancel the run, ComfyUI stops waiting, but KIE still makes the video and bills it. Collect it with **video-03-recover-a-video**."
            ],
            "title": "Note"
        },
